    <Folder>
      <name>Stops</name>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Mather Point</name>
        <description>verified 2026-09-26. Mather Point overlook on the South Rim Rim Trail (Wikidata P625). Drive = Grand Canyon Visitor Center parking (NPS API coordinates), a 300 m walk from the overlook.</description>
        <styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-112.108056,36.061667,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Petrified Forest National Park</name>
        <description>verified 2026-09-26. Query names only the park; point = the park's main visitor center per NPS: Painted Desert Visitor Center at the I-40 north entrance, which the route from Grand Canyon reaches first. Old Nominatim point (34.974,-109.708) was 12 km SE in the park interior, off the road network.</description>
        <styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-109.781577,35.065578,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Saguaro National Park Visitor Center</name>
        <description>verified 2026-09-26. Red Hills Visitor Center, 2700 N Kinney Rd, Saguaro West (NPS API; the Census match for the address is 200 m away). Old Nominatim point was Saguaro East (Rincon Mountain district), 55 km away.</description>
        <styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-111.197318,32.254482,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Guadalupe Mountains National Park</name>
        <description>verified 2026-09-26. Query names only the park; point = the park's main visitor center per NPS: Pine Springs Visitor Center on US 62/180. Old Nominatim point was 7.8 km WNW in the backcountry.</description>
        <styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-104.82206,31.893622,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
      <Placemark>
        <name>Carlsbad Caverns National Park</name>
        <description>verified 2026-09-26. Query names only the park; point = the park's main visitor center per NPS: the visitor center at the end of the entrance road. Old Nominatim point was 16 km SW, off the road network.</description>
        <styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl>
        <Point>
