      <Placemark>
        <name>Big Bend National Park</name>
        <description>verified 2026-09-26. Query names only the park; point = the park's main visitor center per NPS: Panther Junction Visitor Center (park headquarters). Old Nominatim point was 1.3 km ENE of it.</description>
        <styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl>
