      <Placemark>
        <name>Hot Springs National Park</name>
        <description>verified 2026-09-26. The query says 'Arizona 71901', but ZIP 71901 and the park are in Hot Springs, Arkansas, so it is kept as Hot Springs National Park, AR. Point = Fordyce Bathhouse Visitor Center on Bathhouse Row, Central Ave (NPS API). Old point was 2.7 km NE, on Hot Springs Mountain.</description>
        <styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-93.053406,34.513763,0</coordinates>
        </Point>
      </Placemark>
