      <Placemark>
        <name>Great Smoky Mountains National Park</name>
        <description>verified 2026-09-26. Query names the park and Tennessee; point = Sugarlands Visitor Center, the main Tennessee-side visitor center near Gatlinburg (NPS API). Old Nominatim point was a backcountry centroid 13 km SE.</description>
