      <Placemark>
        <name>Acadia National Park</name>
        <description>verified 2026-09-26. Same string as major-landmarks row 28. Display = the park's Wikidata P625. Drive = Sand Beach on the Park Loop Road, following that page's 2015 Google distance-matrix evidence that the Acadia endpoint was deep in the park, well past Hulls Cove Visitor Center. There is no matrix for this 2016 page; alternative: Hulls Cove VC 44.408542,-68.246137.</description>
        <styleUrl>#stop</styleUrl>
        <Point>
          <coordinates>-68.21667,44.35,0</coordinates>
